{"id":"n78697-1-11","stage":1,"title":"책장 · 书柜","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78697-1-11-1","ko":"엄마, 책들이 늘어나서 새 책장을 하나 사야겠어요.","zh":"妈妈，书越堆越多，我得买个新的书架了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"책들이","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책들이","audio":"/audio/8a77efbf76854d332e20.mp3"}},{"text":"늘어나서","meaning":"增，涨，扩大","explanation":"늘어나다：增，涨，扩大；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"늘어나다","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62833","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘어나서","audio":"/audio/7618eb97b66fb528a1ef.mp3"}},{"text":"새","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새：新的","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17884","senseId":"1","lemma":"새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}},{"text":"책장을","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책장을","audio":"/audio/5e3ec4ff50a601f1bef2.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"사야겠어요.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사야겠어요","audio":"/audio/c779d7d6a1924f701bcb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"ba47d0c0fad38891","term":"늘어나다","zh":"增，涨，扩大","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3","entryId":"62833","definition":"体积、数量或程度比原来渐渐变大或变多。","pronunciation":["느러나다"]},{"id":"e2d38c50201cf36d","term":"새","zh":"新的","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3","entryId":"17884","definition":"不是已有的，而是第一次出现的。","pronunciation":["새"]},{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/892498820d5065e89fc4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78697-1-11-2","ko":"그래. 네 방에 책장을 들여놔야겠구나.","zh":"嗯，那就在你房间里放个书架吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"방에","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방에","audio":"/audio/6744ad97e6c1288d41a3.mp3"}},{"text":"책장을","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책장을","audio":"/audio/5e3ec4ff50a601f1bef2.mp3"}},{"text":"들여놔야겠구나.","meaning":"拿进；放，放置","explanation":"들이다：拿进；놓다：放，放置；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"들이다","audio":"/audio/d301b4f8af6e22a42158.mp3"},{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15078","senseId":"5","lemma":"들이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들여놔야겠구나","audio":"/audio/279dd1fe5a39cba71885.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":